# Short landscape phone (844 x 390 at DPR 3), by finger: the Daily (its course
# validated on the worker) played to its results by keys, then a challenge with
# its pause menu, Settings and Help, Leave round; Practice started and left.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Tumble
frames 30
save tc-land-title
touch Daily challenge
until 900 =GO!
frames 2
hold KeyW
repeat 9000 until Score breakdown
key Space 1
frames 0
key ShiftLeft 1
frames 1
end
release KeyW
frames 30
expect Daily challenge —
save tc-land-results
touch Mode select
until 300 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch Challenges
until 300 Feet on the Ground
frames 10
touch Feet on the Ground
until 400 =GO!
frames 60
save tc-land-race
key Escape 1
until 300 Retry round
frames 10
save tc-land-pause
touch =Settings
until 300 Open Options
frames 10
save tc-land-settings
touch Camera shake
frames 10
touch Done
until 300 Retry round
frames 10
touch =Help
until 300 How to play
frames 10
save tc-land-help
touch Done
until 300 Retry round
frames 10
touch Leave round
until 300 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch Practice
until 300 Unranked. Restart
frames 10
save tc-land-practice
touch Start
until 400 =GO!
frames 30
touch =Pause
until 300 Resume
frames 10
touch Resume
frames 30
key Escape 1
until 300 Leave round
frames 10
touch Leave round
until 300 Choose a mode
